          "4) Say these truths over one another in community, not only over yourself (Col 3:16). 5) Let them change how you see other people too (2 Cor 5:16). 6) Remember that these are realities about a Person. The aim is not to master a list but to know Jesus, in whom the list is already true (Phil 3:10)."
